  "note": "Two-column roster: column 1 at col 24, column 2 at col 76. Lines 22, 25, 31, 33, 38 and 43 each carry a section heading in one column beside a person in the other ('SPECIAL AREAS', 'SEVENTH GRADE', 'FOREIGN LANGUAGE', 'EIGHTH GRADE', 'LEARNING CENTER', 'ACHIEVE PROGRAM, 110'); because every line may be listed once they are filed under entries, and those headings still govern the grade_or_dept of the entries below them in their own column. Line 29 column 1 reads 'Computer Lab, Rm. 107' -- a room, not a person -- so only the column-2 teacher is an entry. Lines 23 and 27 each name two people sharing one room/subject. Chad Adams appears twice, as Dean of Students (line 14) and as a seventh grade teacher (line 31), as printed."
